    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360-Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and videos of the bike from all angles, noting scratches, dents, and component wear. This digital record serves as evidence for both the owner and the transport provider.</p>
