    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Battery Terminal Checks</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Clean terminals, tighten connections, and secure the battery to prevent movement. A well‑maintained battery reduces the chance of short circuits or accidental discharge.</p>
