    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Keep fuel at no more than 25 % of tank capacity. This limits weight, reduces spill risk, and complies with most transport guidelines, including those for bike parcel in bus and bike parcel in train process.</p>
