<p>Understanding the <a href="https://www.irctc.co.in/web-bike-transport">bike transport irctc</a> process helps when opting for Indian Railways bike transport. IRCTC requires a clear audit, proper fuel level, and secured battery. For <a href="https://www.irctc.co.in/web-bike-parcel-in-bus">bike parcel in bus</a> services, similar checks apply, and the vehicle must be locked in a designated compartment.</p>

