</div>

<p>The delivery team also provides the recipient with the original LR bilty, the complete set of pickup photographs, and a detailed handover checklist. Any noted discrepancies are highlighted in the checklist and accompanied by corrective actions, such as repair orders or mileage adjustments.</p>
<p>This comprehensive documentation creates a clear audit trail, reduces the risk of post‑delivery disputes, and ensures that both parties have a mutual understanding of the vehicle’s condition at the point of transfer.</p>

<p>By adhering to this structured handover protocol—daylight re‑inspection, precise odometer verification, and a signed condition sign‑off—logistics operators guarantee a transparent, accountable, and legally sound transfer of two‑wheelers and motorcycles to their final destination.</p></div>
